      {
        "name": "places/ChIJae1Hlt7iAzQR0Iitq7NhJmI/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KVlgzSnVVbk53YlVObVVIZEdOVXhCTWxOSVJGRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "（2026年7月1日）\n因為下錯車站，誤打誤撞來到了這家酒店。本來只是匆忙停留，但當時因為趕著搭即將起飛的航班，非常著急需要幫助時，酒店的工作人員主動且積極地提供協助。\n整個過程中他們非常熱情、親切，同時也展現出極高的專業度與效率，讓我在緊張的情況下感到非常安心與感激。\n真的非常感謝他們的幫忙！這次的經歷讓我對這家酒店留下了非常好的印象。下次再來香港，一定會再次選擇入住這裡！\n\n(July 1, 2026)\nI happened to arrive at this hotel by mistake after getting off at the wrong station. What was meant to be a brief stop turned into a memorable experience.\nAt the time, I was in a rush to catch an upcoming flight and urgently needed assistance. The hotel staff were incredibly proactive and helpful. They were warm, friendly, and handled everything in a highly professional and efficient manner.\nTheir support really put me at ease during a stressful moment, and I am truly grateful for their kindness.\nThis experience left me with a very positive impression of the hotel. I will definitely choose to stay here again on my next visit to Hong Kong!",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
